<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.2"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Are you looking for a way to make the most of your cost share dollars? If so, let me introduce you to EverQuote’s new digital Marketing Services.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.2"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">With EverQuote’s Marketing Services product, our team of paid search experts will advertise on your behalf to connect you with high-intent shoppers, boost your online visibility, and diversify your customer acquisition strategies. </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">The best part- EverQuote’s digital Marketing Services is eligible for cost share!&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.2"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Limited spots are available so I’d love to grab 5-10 minutes of your time to discuss how it can help your agency. You can reach me at {{{Sender.Phone}}} or book some time on my calendar {{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.2"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Talk soon,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

